{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30953","headline":"五月一日紫宸候对时属禁直穿内而行因书六韵 · 郑畋","name":"五月一日紫宸候对时属禁直穿内而行因书六韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朱夏五更後，步廊三里余。\n有人从翰苑，穿入内中书。\n漏响飘银箭，灯光照玉除。\n禁扉犹鏁钥，宫妓已妆梳。\n紫府游应似，钧天梦不如。\n尘埃九重外，谁信在清虚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑畋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30953.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30953","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}